msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But now that we’ve established trade routes of our own,⟪k:1⟫my country’s fighting tooth and "
"nail to push its exports."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais maintenant que nous avons établi nos propres routes commerciales, mon pays se bat bec "
"et ongles pour imposer ses produits."

