msgid "⟪k:0⟫And in fact, some have lost a few teeth in the fight already."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Et il se trouve que certains y ont déjà laissé quelques plumes."

#: scenario2:scenario2_AA9AED17_4101_47DE_AB5A_10979EDCB7ED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
