msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though I know not how Bestia felt, at the very least, I was glad we had invited the wanderer "
"into the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je ne savais pas ce qu’en pensait Bestia, mais moi, en tout cas, j’étais contente qu’on ait "
"invité le visiteur dans la maison."

#: scenario2:scenario2_E9B23050_CDE1_4F67_B2DB_F464739AAAA7
